ArabicCheck ships the third-party files below. None of them is committed to
this repository: `npm run fetch-models` downloads the model files from the
pinned commits in `models.lock.json` and checks each against its recorded
size and SHA-256; the runtime files are copied from the installed npm package
at build time.

