tinyfix: English spelling list and real-word model
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:    https://huggingface.co/paperweight/tinyfix
Revision:  8efdf5cd91b32584f4077aa0e8ecaf48f7651bef (used by the tinyfix 0.1.1 npm package)
Licence:   MIT (model card), Copyright (c) 2026 Caleb Fahlgren (tinyfix package licence)
Files:     words.txt, wrong-word.onnx, wrong-word-vocab.txt, wrong-word-confusions.txt
Served at: /models/en/

