tinyfix-ar: Arabic real-word and spelling model with its lexicon
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:    https://huggingface.co/ali77a/tinyfix-ar
Revision:  f760e7eafcdd030fb5043a4b10a00b78cc0c5d3a (tag v1.0.0; used by the tinyfix-ar 1.0.0 npm package)
